,"material":"preprint"},{"key":"ca3cb27c028a7b16567b199b30176beb","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/ca3cb27c028a7b16567b199b30176beb","label":"fig:hatpc","source":"arxiv","caption":"Schematic view of the High-Angle TPC.","filename":"TPC_schematic.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"0f8488514a46624b9d8da46e0c6d03fc","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/0f8488514a46624b9d8da46e0c6d03fc","label":"fig:fieldcage1","source":"arxiv","caption":"Model of a HA-TPC including an End-Plate. The two Field Cage boxes joined by means of their flanges in the middle of the detector are illustrated. The central cathode is also visible in transparency. The end-plates, joined at the boxes end by flanges, embed the module-frames and allow gas-tight sealing of the inner volume.","filename":"TPC_MMS_HOR.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"2c07d67447e1cd237b84514305184a00","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/2c07d67447e1cd237b84514305184a00","label":"fig:strip_configuration","source":"arxiv","caption":"Field shaping electrodes located onto the inner Field Cage surface, with the related electric circuit.","filename":"TPC_strip_config_1.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"951d0d77d0399168142435f9a3caa72b","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/951d0d77d0399168142435f9a3caa72b","label":"fig:FC_1","source":"arxiv","caption":"Left: model of a HA-TPC Field Cage made of two boxes joined in the middle of the detector, where the cathode is located. Right: Field Cage vertical cross-section. The view is such that the drift direction is vertical.","filename":"FCnew_copia.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"7e9cd4cdbd0161fe3b2822fd5d245c4a","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/7e9cd4cdbd0161fe3b2822fd5d245c4a","label":"fig:TPC_CC_1","source":"arxiv","caption":"Left: closeup of the cathode supported through a spacer on the grooved flange of a Cage box. Right: cathode infixed between the flanges of the two Cage boxes. Gas flow between the two Cage boxes volumes is allowed by the distance of the cathode edges from the inner surface of the flange and by the wedged cathode edges.","filename":"Cathode_Gas_flow.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"b4ffa6136865964117aa6c004465b2e2","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/b4ffa6136865964117aa6c004465b2e2","label":"fig:TPC_MF_cad","source":"arxiv","caption":"The TPC \\MF","filename":"TPC_MF_cad.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"92ccd79450b15312d6df458f32df9f5c","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/92ccd79450b15312d6df458f32df9f5c","label":"fig:FC_sim_mech","source":"arxiv","caption":"Result of the FEM simulation of the Field Cage with an over-pressure of 10mbar. The maximum deformation is estimated to be 0.23mm.","filename":"TPC_FC_mech_sim_10mbar.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"72afc6162cb6ec6a6db0b6f2b79b6e0c","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/72afc6162cb6ec6a6db0b6f2b79b6e0c","label":"fig:TPC_MF","source":"arxiv","caption":" : Simplified model (without \\MM)","filename":"TPC_MF_surf.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"2f9a1f2d1ff059931d27d808fecd4872","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/2f9a1f2d1ff059931d27d808fecd4872","label":"fig:TPC_MF","source":"arxiv","caption":" : Realistic model (with Micromegas)","filename":"TPC_MF_as.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"483a476218afb3b7ecb9946b5d5201f6","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/483a476218afb3b7ecb9946b5d5201f6","label":"fig:TPC_MF_surf_4mbar","source":"arxiv","caption":" : Deformation [\\si{\\milli\\metre}]","filename":"TPC_MF_surf_def_4mbar.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"f3a81bb8d4c48325c274a4da3d047262","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/f3a81bb8d4c48325c274a4da3d047262","label":"fig:TPC_MF_surf_4mbar","source":"arxiv","caption":" : Von-Mises stress [\\si{\\mega\\pascal}]","filename":"TPC_MF_surf_stress_4mbar.png","material":"preprint"},{"key":"20c5cb33e0d030866ada07001881fb04","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/20c5cb33e0d030866ada07001881fb04","label":"fig:TPC_MF_as_4mbar","source":"arxiv","caption":" : Deformation [\\si{\\milli\\metre}]","filename":"TPC_MF_